OL,3,ASupreme Court clears way for Trump to
OL,4,Akeep building White House ballroom
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Supreme Court has ruled that
OL,7,Fconstruction of a $400m (#297m)
OL,8,Fballroom at the White House can go
OL,9,Fahead, in a victory for President
OL,10,FDonald Trump.
OL,12,FIn a 5-4 ruling, the justices granted
OL,13,Fthe Trump administration's emergency
OL,14,Frequest, blocking lower court rulings
OL,15,Fthat would have halted construction of
OL,16,Fan above-ground portion of the project.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
