OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASupreme Court clears way for Trump to
OL,4,Akeep building White House ballroom
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Chief Justice John Roberts, a
OL,7,Fconservative, sided with the three
OL,8,Fliberal justices to dissent, writing
OL,9,Fthat "construction is likely unlawful"
OL,10,Fbecause Congress has not approved the
OL,11,Fproject.
OL,13,FThe National Trust for Historic
OL,14,FPreservation filed the legal challenge,
OL,15,Farguing that the president did not have
OL,16,Funilateral authority to proceed with
OL,17,Fconstruction.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
